<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Online Sticker Maker</p>
      <h1>Sticker Maker Online</h1>
      <p>
        Make stickers online from a text prompt or portrait. Generate one sticker, run a small
        batch, retry failed prompts, and download finished files from sticker history. Guests get
        3 free generations with no sign up.
      </p>
      <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">Open Online Sticker Maker</a>
      <p>Free &middot; 3 generations without an account &middot; PNG, WebP and original downloads</p>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Prompt based stickers</h2>
        <p>Write a simple idea, choose one clear subject, and keep the style focused for cleaner sticker results.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Batch workflow</h2>
        <p>Add one prompt per line to create a small batch, then track progress and failed items in history.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Download options</h2>
        <p>Use original, PNG, or WebP downloads depending on whether you need editing support or smaller web files.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Why use an online sticker maker instead of an app?</h2>
      <p>
        A browser tool removes the install step and works on a laptop, Chromebook, or phone. Guests
        can try 3 generations with no sign up. Generation needs an internet connection, while
        account sign-in attaches eligible results to an account for continued access.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Prompt based stickers</h2>
      <p>
        A useful prompt names the subject, the sticker job, and the visual style. Try one clear
        subject such as a robot, flower, portrait, mascot, or reaction, then add a clean outline,
        bold border, or simple background. Extra subjects and adjectives often make results cluttered.
      </p>
      <p>
        The online sticker maker turns words into downloadable artwork rather than selecting from a
        fixed template library. Start short, inspect the result, and change one descriptor at a time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Batch workflow</h2>
      <p>
        Add one prompt per line to explore a small set of related ideas. Keep the core style the same
        and vary one thing at a time, such as emotion, palette, or border. Each generation in a batch
        uses 1 credit, and failed generations return their credit.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep every prompt in a batch at the same visual style.</li>
        <li>Track processing and failed items in history.</li>
        <li>Retry a failed prompt without starting the idea from scratch.</li>
        <li>Download completed items individually or as a batch ZIP.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Download options</h2>
      <p>Choose a format based on what you will do with the sticker next.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Format</th><th>Use it when</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>PNG</td><td>You will edit the artwork or need broad compatibility.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>WebP</td><td>You want a smaller file for a web page, gallery, or chat.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Original</td><td>You want the upstream generated format without conversion.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        Generated artwork is typically 1024 x 1024 px. Resize it after download when a destination
        platform requires a different size.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Online sticker maker workflow</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Start with text to sticker for an idea, object, mascot, or reaction.</li>
        <li>Use face or photo to sticker for an avatar-style result from a picture.</li>
        <li>Track processing and failed stickers in history, then retry or cancel when needed.</li>
        <li>Select completed stickers and download single files or batch ZIP packages.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Making stickers for Discord and chat apps</h2>
      <p>
        Discord custom stickers must be exactly 320 x 320 px, PNG for static artwork or APNG for
        animated artwork, at 512 KB or less. Transparency is recommended rather than required, and
        custom sticker uploads also depend on server Boosts.
      </p>
      <p>
        WhatsApp asks for 512 x 512 px WebP stickers with transparency, static files under 100 KB,
        animated files up to 500 KB, and a tray icon. A pack needs at least 3 stickers and can hold
        up to 30. Telegram accepts PNG or WebP with one side exactly 512 pixels and the other at 512
        pixels or less. Resize and convert after downloading, then confirm current platform rules.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Online sticker maker or sticker printing?</h2>
      <p>
        An online sticker maker produces downloadable artwork for chats, profiles, thumbnails,
        slides, and digital designs. Sticker printing produces physical vinyl or die-cut products
        shipped to an address and requires a print vendor, cut path, and minimum order.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you need physical stickers, use a print service. If you need the digital artwork itself,
        generate it here and download PNG, WebP, or original files.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Sticker maker prompt examples</h2>
      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>friendly robot mascot sticker, blue accents, clean white border</code>
        <code>cute flower character smiling, simple background, sticker icon style</code>
        <code>travel airplane mascot, happy expression, bold outline, social sticker</code>
        <code>coffee cup character, sleepy expression, warm palette, rounded border</code>
        <code>community badge sticker, flat colors, centered composition, no text</code>
        <code>reaction sticker, surprised face, thick outline, plain background</code>
        <code>pet avatar sticker, fluffy texture, rounded frame, bright colors</code>
        <code>seasonal mascot sticker, festive palette, decorative border, simple shapes</code>
        <code>app icon sticker, single object, high contrast, soft shadow</code>
        <code>sports mascot sticker, dynamic pose, bold shapes, two-color palette</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>What makes a good online sticker?</h2>
      <p>
        A good AI sticker has one clear subject, a readable silhouette, simple colors, and a
        specific emotion or use case. At small sizes, fewer elements usually read better than a
        longer prompt with many competing details.
      </p>
      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/ai-sticker-generator"}>AI Sticker Generator</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/face-to-sticker"}>Face to Sticker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/photo-to-sticker"}>Photo to Sticker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/reaction-sticker-maker"}>Reaction Sticker Maker</.link>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Sticker maker online FAQ</h2>
      <div class="saas-faq">
        <details open><summary>What can I make with the online sticker maker?</summary><p>You can create prompt-based stickers, portrait stickers, avatar stickers, mascot ideas, and small batches from the browser.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I manage generated stickers?</summary><p>Yes. History supports search, filters, favorites, delete, retry, cancel, and batch detail pages for generated sticker work.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is this online sticker maker credit based?</summary><p>Yes. Guests can try 3 generations before signup, and each generation uses 1 credit. A failed generation returns its credit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need to install anything or create an account?</summary><p>No. It runs in the browser with nothing to install, and the 3 free guest generations need no account.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What formats can I download?</summary><p>Original, PNG, or WebP. PNG is safer for editing, WebP is smaller for the web, and original keeps the generated format.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I make several stickers at once?</summary><p>Yes. Add one prompt per line to run a small batch, then track progress and failed items in history. Each generation uses 1 credit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What size do stickers need to be for Discord or WhatsApp?</summary><p>Discord custom stickers must be 320 x 320 px PNG or APNG within 512 KB. WhatsApp stickers must be 512 x 512 px WebP with transparency and static files under 100 KB. Resize after downloading.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
